    metaDescription: "Learn how to design AI products users trust and adopt. This complete AI product UI/UX design guide covers research, onboarding, trust, prompts, dashboards, and conversion.",
    focusKeyword: "AI product UI/UX design",
    secondaryKeywords: ["AI UX design", "AI product design", "AI SaaS UX", "AI interface design", "AI product design agency"],
    excerpt: "Learn how to design AI products users trust and adopt. This complete AI product UI/UX design guide covers research, onboarding, trust, prompts, dashboards, and conversion.",
    image: "/blogs/AI Product UI UX Design.png",
