    metaDescription: "Avoid common AI UX mistakes. Learn how vague outputs, poor onboarding, weak trust signals, and missing recovery paths reduce AI product adoption.",
    focusKeyword: "AI UX mistakes",
    secondaryKeywords: ["AI product adoption", "AI UX best practices", "AI product design", "AI UX design", "AI SaaS adoption"],
